Description:It is your first main phase. You control Craw Wurm (6/4) and two untapped Mountains, and have Temur Battle Rage (double strike; ferocious: also trample if you control a creature with power 4 or greater) in hand. The opponent is at 4 life and controls an untapped Wall of Stone (0/8). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-trample-lethal-after-first-strike | Lethal damage for trample accounts for damage already marked on the blocker (CR 702.19c, 510.1c-d): blocked by the Wall, the double-striking Wurm deals 6 in the first step and needs to assign only 2 more in the second, trampling 4 over
